3070153890993_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6YPalq9SpREQ7kNvwFo5WvX&_nc_oc=Adkj1GCtsmq29eLU0Li8meNICIIZo4sJVs6YfCNtAoq85RV1X7gidBcUrJMkpsrY3Cw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afvts4hGoaoBjL0r4EBPQc4shO0CtWNhxDRcWk6tR9c49Q&oe=69A59AF7"}, {"file_name": "Artboard 1.png", "id": "1543351499921825", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974887_1543351503255158_348442130487521407_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=neHKXO902g0Q7kNvwGwA4t5&_nc_oc=Adml2mX5WUTaDbvMS3QYmH4YIul8Pde0sxlOuvB4xrcVKLXPYOac4xcAnltFdi9jdLk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuChTPrHSUU2a6xlTIIyk6Hg5YkIyS7j6OQKTwtqMVEmQ&oe=69A5A106"}, {"file_name": "Artboard 3.png", "id": "912383657378781", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031432_912383660712114_2572436446715478623_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=swQjfACEN1kQ7kNvwFQW8MQ&_nc_oc=AdmhoG6E7Z9sd2aNuWlwyb8YWKu2jWePQEhj7AQpa19eipSDE6sUl6RKsBL_wTwBep4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afvia7UVljl3eCeeMcCG_jrX4ZThzBmZck96msBCjsqZ6A&oe=69A587FA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "38974450_2251639131854765_8396477208328520911_n.png", "id": "3748813912049179", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031311_3748813915382512_2166423531006939259_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6CuKFQERNFgQ7kNvwGlIcPd&_nc_oc=AdnpBwDQmOOqdziBh4JKq72_bAk4DeKPybMfwcheUPPyQJZpMbpEsYFixvI3DwJ2SUA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuABkdaFQ6EivRyJntUlVIA71zwM4LTeEuftTE5FRqOdw&oe=69A59C8D"}, "display_name": "Cellular Safari", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Safari Cellular** is an innovative virtual reality app that turns learning about **cellular biology** into an exciting adventure. Designed for **students, educators and science enthusiasts**, this app allows you to explore an **animal cell in 3D** like never before. Through an immersive interface, you can navigate through different cell structures, such as **the nucleus, mitochondria, and endoplasmic reticulum**, discovering their functions and importance.\n\nEach component of the cell is represented in stunning detail, allowing you to observe and understand complex biological processes in a visually engaging way. **Integrated artificial intelligence** is at your disposal to answer any questions you may have while exploring, providing clear and detailed explanations.\n\nCellular Safari is not just a passive educational experience; it includes a series of **mini interactive games** designed to consolidate your knowledge in a fun and engaging way. Through **challenges and quizzes**, you can test your understanding of biological concepts, making learning an active and stimulating process.\n\nPerfect for use in education or as a self-study tool, Cellular Safari offers a new and innovative way to explore the microscopic world of the animal cell. With **high-quality graphics** and an **intuitive user experience**, this app turns the study of biology into an unforgettable adventure.", "short_description": "Discover the fascinating world of the animal cell with Cell Safari, the educational VR app that lets you explore cellular structures in 3D. Through interactive mini-games and advanced artificial intelligence, learn scientific concepts while having fun. Ideal for students and biology enthusiasts, this immersive experience makes learning an exciting adventure."}]}, "developer_name": "Just Ware", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.iubenda.com/privacy-policy/93783224", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.iubenda.com/terms-and-conditions/93783224", "publisher_name": "Just Ware", "support_website_url": "https://justware.it/supporto/", "website_url": "https://justware.it/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_top